          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async def main():  # 3.11+",
            "  async with TaskGroup() as tg:",
            "    tg.create_task(sleep(1))",
            "    tg.create_task(sleep(1))",
            "  # exits after ~1s, not 2s"
          ],
          "note": "TaskGroup and sleep come from asyncio"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "5. Summary",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`async def` is a ==recipe==. await or a task runs it",
            "Only `await` can switch tasks (cooperative multitasking)",
            "`sleep(0)` is the simplest checkpoint",
            "Use `timeout()` / `wait_for()` to set deadlines on slow work"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. sleep(0) Checkpoint",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async def crunch(rows):",
            "  for i, r in enumerate(rows):",
            "    work(r)",
            "    if i % 1000 == 0:",
            "      await asyncio.sleep(0)"
          ],
          "note": "lets other tasks run between chunks"
        },
        {
