          "text": "9. Common Slip-ups",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`fetch()` without await: the coroutine ==never runs==",
            "`time.sleep(1)` blocks the **whole** loop",
            "`asyncio.run()` inside a running loop raises RuntimeError",
            "Dropping the `create_task` result: the task may be GC'd"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Rule of thumb",
          "text": "Create tasks to overlap waits, `await` them to get results, and wrap slow calls in `timeout()`."
        }
      ],
