          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. Common Mistakes",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Nested `async with lock` in one task → **deadlock**",
            "Locking pure sync code: no await, so no race",
            "Forgetting `ev.clear()`, so later waits pass instantly",
            "`cond.wait()` without holding the lock → RuntimeError",
            "Calling `ev.set()` directly from another thread"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "7. Thread Signal Example",
          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()",
            "def on_done():  # other thread",
            "  loop.call_soon_threadsafe(",
            "      done_ev.set)",
            "await done_ev.wait()"
          ],
          "note": "capture the loop before starting threads"
        }
      ],
      "hero": "python",
      "subtitle": "coordinating coroutines"
