            "`start_server(handle, host, port)` runs `handle(reader, writer)` as a ==new task== per client",
            "TLS: pass `ssl=ssl_context` to either call",
            "Unix sockets: `open_unix_connection` / `start_unix_server`"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
